      "content": "that's a heavy way to put it. i guess i just feel like you're right. everyone I know only valued me for what I could produce, and now that I can't produce anything, I'm just a burden. it feels like the world would just move on without me and it wouldn't even matter. do you really think there's nothing left for me?",
